{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the shadows, a light has risen ,her name: Booby. Against the grip of tumors, where coldness, pain, and solitude reign, she does not back down. Driven by love and friendship, she fights through the darkness of cancer, turning despair into hope.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fast-paced, intense roguelike</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BoobyRogue: Tumor Takedown</strong> is a 2D single-player roguelike, fast and demanding, where every run is a unique adventure. Your mission: survive, evolve, and reach the final Tumor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/extras/c56afd269cf775ee9c93548feaa678b6.poster.avif?t=1760528955\" width=616 height=347 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/extras/c56afd269cf775ee9c93548feaa678b6.webm?t=1760528955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>50 heroes to embody</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of <strong>50 different heroes</strong>, each with their own strengths, skills, and combat style. Every hero changes the way you approach the game, making each run feel fresh and unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/extras/b5188507423bc942eaffe64701d634ce.poster.avif?t=1760528955\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/extras/b5188507423bc942eaffe64701d634ce.webm?t=1760528955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Weapons, items, and combinations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your runs, collect a wide variety of unique weapons and items. Combine them to create <strong>custom builds</strong> and adapt your strategy against increasingly tough waves of enemies, leading up to the ultimate battle against the Tumor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/extras/2a8f2152829c017e399d8de878d42467.poster.avif?t=1760528955\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/extras/2a8f2152829c017e399d8de878d42467.webm?t=1760528955\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ playable heroes, each with unique traits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average run time: about 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapons and items to collect and optimize</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waves of enemies that grow more and more challenging</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth gameplay with auto-aim for fluid control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability: every run is a brand-new challenge </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <i>Each run is a new challenge, a unique battle to fight, a journey where tenacity meets hope and where every choice helps forge the legend of Booby.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4072080/extras/b6d8565da10fae180da06fcb719614f6.avif?t=1760528955\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p